# No environment variables are required in local-storage mode:
# the app's database runs in each visitor's browser.
#
# The server-database version (libSQL / Turso) is archived in
# archive/database-version.zip. If you restore it, it needs:
# AUTH_SECRET=change-me-to-a-long-random-string
# DATABASE_URL=libsql://your-db.turso.io
# DATABASE_AUTH_TOKEN=
